Drop .glb / .gltf files in this folder.

Convention (see app/lab/kit.ts):
  metres, floor at y = 0, front is local +Z.
  Tabletop props (laptop, mug, notebook) sit on HexTable 0.726 / LeadTable 0.77.
  Place with <LabPart id="…" position={[x, y, z]} rotationY={yaw} />.

Digital Lead (from story-04-lead.png):
  lead-table.glb
  lead-chair.glb
  lead-figure-point.glb
  lead-figure-hardhat.glb
  lead-figure-sit.glb
  lead-figure-stand-tablet.glb
  lead-figure-stand-plans.glb
  lead-laptop.glb
  lead-mug.glb
  lead-notebook.glb
  lead-blueprints.glb
  lead-dashboard.glb

Other samples:
  walker.glb, hex-table.glb, office-chair.glb, humanoid-sitting.glb,
  laptop.glb, bookshelf-table.glb, digital-massing.glb

Regenerate:
  pnpm models:lead
